Randomized encryption provides:
				Same plaintext → different ciphertext
				Strongest protection
				Prevents:
					equality comparisons
					joins
					indexing
					pattern inference

Deterministic encryption provides:
				Same plaintext → same ciphertext
				Supports: =, IN, Joins
				Does not support: LIKE, , <, Range queries
					
